stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> SLEEP : fall_asleep (5초 경과)
    SLEEP --> IDLE : wake_up (SPACE)
    IDLE --> RUN : start_run (←/→ 누름)
    SLEEP --> RUN : start_run (←/→ 누름)
    RUN --> IDLE : stop_run (←/→ 모두 뗌, dir == 0)

    note right of IDLE
        SPACE: fire_ball() -> Ball 생성
        상태/방향 변화 없음
    end note

    note right of RUN
        SPACE: fire_ball() -> Ball 생성
        상태/방향 변화 없음
        ←/→: dir, face_dir 갱신만
    end note

    note right of SLEEP
        SPACE: wake_up
        ←/→: start_run
    end note
